chx:Keys owl:disjointWith chx:Practice .
chx:Keys owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
chx:Format owl:disjointWith chx:Address .
chx:Format owl:disjointWith chx:Practice .
chx:Format owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
