chx:Address owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
chx:Practice owl:disjointWith chx:Semantics .
chx:hasOwner a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "owned by"@en ; rdfs:subPropertyOf rd:hasOwningConcept ;
    rdfs:comment "A concept owned by the concept it belongs to, as the chapter's examples use it between typed things; domain and range are the union of every type the A-Box shows on the two sides (BP-D57 step 3)."@en ;
    rdfs:domain [ <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( chx:BchCode chx:Checksum chx:Commitment chx:GeneratorPoint chx:Hash160 chx:HumanReadablePart chx:InputScript chx:MultisigScript chx:OutputScript chx:PointMultiplication chx:RedeemScript chx:VersionPrefix chx:WitnessProgram chx:WitnessVersion ) ] ;
    rdfs:range [ <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> owl:Class ; owl:unionOf ( chx:Base58Check chx:Bech32Address chx:Bech32mAddress chx:Commitment chx:P2pk chx:P2pkhAddress chx:P2shAddress chx:RedeemScript chx:Secp256k1 ) ] ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .

#################################################################
# Connectedness repair (discipline v2.19.0, BP-D56 and BP-D57), 2026-10-19.
# The datatype properties the A-Box uses and nothing declared, then the relations
# between the chapter's subject branches that the chapter's own sources state.
#################################################################
chx:input a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "input expression"@en ; rdfs:comment "The expression an input/output example evaluates."@en ; rdfs:domain rd:IOExample ; rdfs:range xsd:string ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:output a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:label "output value"@en ; rdfs:comment "The value that evaluating the example expression gives."@en ; rdfs:domain rd:IOExample ; rdfs:range xsd:string ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:encodesHash160 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "commits to"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A P2PKH address encodes the HASH160 of a public key. Basis: the chapter says of P2PKH address: 'the base58check encoding of version 0x00 and the HASH160 of the public key'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:P2pkhAddress ; rdfs:range chx:Hash160 ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:isEncodedAsBase58Check a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "is encoded as"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A P2PKH address is a base58check encoding. Basis: the chapter says of P2PKH address: 'the base58check encoding of version 0x00 and the HASH160 of the public key'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:P2pkhAddress ; rdfs:range chx:Base58Check ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:locksWithPublicKey a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "locks funds with"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A pay to public key output locks funds with the receiver's public key. Basis: the chapter says of Pay to public key (P2PK): 'locks funds with the receiver's public key'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:P2pk ; rdfs:range chx:PublicKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:containsSignature a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "contains"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The input script of a P2PKH output consists of a signature and the public key. Basis: the chapter says of Input script: 'it consists of a signature and the public key'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:InputScript ; rdfs:range chx:DigitalSignature ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:containsPublicKey a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "contains"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The input script of a P2PKH output consists of a signature and the public key. Basis: the chapter says of Input script: 'it consists of a signature and the public key'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:InputScript ; rdfs:range chx:PublicKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:usesCurvePoint a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "uses a point of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A P2TR witness program is a point on the secp256k1 curve. Basis: the chapter says of Pay to taproot (P2TR): 'a point on the secp256k1 curve'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:P2tr ; rdfs:range chx:Secp256k1 ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:commitsToSha256 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "commits to"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A P2WSH output script holds the SHA256 of a script. Basis: the chapter says of Pay to witness script hash (P2WSH): 'OP_0 followed by the 32-byte SHA256 of a script'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:P2wsh ; rdfs:range chx:Sha256 ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:targetsHash160 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "targets"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A preimage attack on a 160-bit function such as HASH160 succeeds with probability 1 in 2 to the 160 per try. Basis: the chapter says of Preimage attack: 'for a secure 160-bit function such as HASH160'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:PreimageAttack ; rdfs:range chx:Hash160 ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:appliesRipemd160 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "applies"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "HASH160 is the RIPEMD-160 of the SHA256 of the data. Basis: the chapter says of HASH160: 'HASH160 is the RIPEMD-160 of the SHA256 of the data'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:Hash160 ; rdfs:range chx:Ripemd160 ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:appliesSha256 a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "applies"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "HASH160 is the RIPEMD-160 of the SHA256 of the data. Basis: the chapter says of HASH160: 'HASH160 is the RIPEMD-160 of the SHA256 of the data'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:Hash160 ; rdfs:range chx:Sha256 ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:specialises a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "specialises"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The secp256k1 curve is an elliptic curve of the form the general definition gives. Basis: the chapter says of The secp256k1 curve: 'The secp256k1 curve, y squared = x cubed + 7'; the chapter says of Elliptic curve: 'set of points (x, y) that satisfy an equation such as y squared = x cubed + 7'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:Secp256k1 ; rdfs:range chx:EllipticCurve ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:encodesPrivateKey a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "encodes"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The wallet import format is the base58check encoding of the private key. Basis: the chapter says of Wallet import format (WIF): 'the base58check encoding of version byte 0x80 and the private key'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:WalletImportFormat ; rdfs:range chx:PrivateKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:extendsPrivateKey a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "extends"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A compressed private key is the private key followed by a one-byte suffix that marks compressed public keys. Basis: the chapter says of Compressed private key: 'it is the private key followed by a one-byte suffix 01'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:CompressedPrivateKey ; rdfs:range chx:PrivateKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:prefixesAddress a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "starts the text of"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The version prefix makes a P2PKH address start with the character 1. Basis: the chapter says of Version prefix: '1 for a P2PKH address, 3 for P2SH'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:VersionPrefix ; rdfs:range chx:P2pkhAddress ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:defaultsToP2wpkh a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "defaults to"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Bitcoin Core's addresstype option defaults to a P2WPKH address. Basis: the chapter says of Default address type: 'defaults to bech32, a P2WPKH address'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:DefaultAddressType ; rdfs:range chx:P2wpkh ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:derivesPrivateKeys a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "derives"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A deterministic wallet derives all its private keys from a single seed. Basis: the chapter says of Deterministic wallet and seed: 'derives all its private keys from a single seed'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:DeterministicWallet ; rdfs:range chx:PrivateKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:linksPaymentsTo a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "links the payments received at"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Receiving several payments to the same address links them together. Basis: the chapter says of Address reuse and privacy: 'Receiving several payments to the same address links them all together'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:AddressReuse ; rdfs:range chx:Address ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:holdsPrivateKeys a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "holds"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A hardware signing device holds private keys and uses them only to sign. Basis: the chapter says of Hardware signing device: 'holds private keys and uses them only to sign'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:HardwareSigningDevice ; rdfs:range chx:PrivateKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:printsPrivateKey a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "prints"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A paper wallet is a private key printed on paper. Basis: the chapter says of Paper wallet: 'a private key printed on paper'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:PaperWallet ; rdfs:range chx:PrivateKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:encryptsPrivateKey a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "encrypts"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "BIP38 encrypts a private key under a passphrase into a base58check string. Basis: the chapter says of Passphrase-protected key: 'BIP38 encrypts a private key under a passphrase into a 58-character base58check string'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:PassphraseProtection ; rdfs:range chx:PrivateKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:testsBech32m a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "gives test cases for"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The BIP350 test vectors give valid and invalid segwit addresses and bech32m strings. Basis: the chapter says of BIP350 test vectors: 'valid and invalid segwit addresses and bech32m strings'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:TestVectors ; rdfs:range chx:Bech32mAddress ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:carriesPublicKey a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "can carry"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A decentralized identifier's DID document can carry verification methods such as public keys. Basis: the chapter says of Decentralized identifier (DID): 'verification methods such as public keys'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:DecentralizedIdentifier ; rdfs:range chx:PublicKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
chx:provesControlOf a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:label "proves control with"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Whoever holds a private key can prove control of the matching public key by signing. Basis: the chapter says of Proof of control by a key: 'Whoever holds a private key can prove control of the matching public key by signing'."@en ;
    rdfs:domain chx:KeyControlProof ; rdfs:range chx:PrivateKey ; rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://example.org/sen0401/ch04/tbox> .
